            "review_title": "Review at Yeebo Seafood & Hot Pot Restaurant",
            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n0\nPremium quality, premium prices.\nAug 2017 • Family\nPosh decor, attentive service, guaranteed tastes, well-stocked fresh seafood and exotic offerings are what you're paying for. Overall a quality Chinese restaurant that doesn't just serve hotpot, but also an extensive menu of favourite Chinese foods such as Peking duck, beef in XO sauce, quails (like pigeons) in five spices marinade, turtle jelly dessert Gui ling gao, etc. They're not limited to just the traditional Chinese dishes too, as they have some more modern/international way of serving up their dishes e.g. sashimi for some of their freshest seafoods such as prawns.\n\nMost exotic: chicken testicles for hotpot\nGotta try: mala hotpot packs a punch (numbing spice so beware!)\nPrice range: ~1usd for each wet serviette gives you an idea\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 28, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
