            "review_text": "SW_Buddy\n79 contributions\n0\nPretentious but mediocre\nMar 2017 • Friends\nEverything cried out for me liking this restaurant. It has a great location. The restaurant is spacious, airy, and clean. The servers look sharp, are clean, and are attentive.\n\nUnfortunately, after dining here several times, I must say I'm underwhelmed. The food is not bad, mind you. It is okay. But, given the price and the promise of the place, \"OK\" was simply not what I was looking for. If you are looking for great Chinese food, you can do better.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 31, 2017",
