            "review_title": "Review at Yeebo Seafood & Hot Pot Restaurant",
            "review_text": "katanankes\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam90 contributions\n0\nChinese cuisine and delectable Dim Sum\nDec 2015 • Friends\nNow that Ming restaurant is closed (at time of writing the building is undertaking major renovations, not sure if or when it will re-open), the District 7 branch of Yeebo is the best option for Chinese food. \n\nI am not a big fan of Chinese food, but I have been at Yeebo several times, for lunch, dinner and Dim Sum breakfast and never been disappointed. \n\nI wish the Dim Sum menu was more extensive, but definitely you can find all the classics items. \n\nThe place is very large, with a few comfortable booths and many big circle tables to accommodate large parties.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 7, 2016",
